 12px;text-align:right;font-weight:600">¥ 2,469.134</td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5"><td style="padding:14px 12px"><p style="font-weight:700;margin:0">Zero</p></td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:center">0</td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:right">¥ 50</td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:right">—</td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:right;font-weight:600">¥ 0</td></tr><tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5"><td style="padding:14px 12px"><p style="font-weight:700;margin:0">Credit</p></td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:center">1</td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:right">¥ -3.25</td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:right">—</td><td style="padding:14px 12px;text-align:right;font-weight:600">¥ -3.25</td></tr></tbody></table><div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:32px"><div style="min-width:240px"><div style="background-color:#f0f0f0;padding:10px 16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect x="3" y="12" width="4" height="9" rx="1" fill="#555"></rect><rect x="10" y="7" width="4" height="14" rx="1" fill="#555"></rect><rect x="17" y="3" width="4" height="18" rx="1" fill="#555"></rect></svg><span style="font-weight:700;font-size:14px;color:#222">Invoice Summary</span></div><div style="border:1px solid #e5e5e5;border-top:none;border-radius:0 0 4px 4px;overflow:hidden"><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0"><span style="color:#555">Subtotal</span><span>¥ 2,465.884</span></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f0f0"><span style="color:#555">Tax</span><span>¥ 246.913</span></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 16px;font-weight:700"><span>Total</span><span>¥ 2,712.797</span></div></div>